  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Add basmati rice and a pinch of salt and cook, uncovered, over high heat until tender, 12 mins. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c3be92f0a31bc0c30103f1-34eb739b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, chop broccoli (including stalk!) into small florets. Thinly slice carrot into rounds. Thinly slice capsicum and red onion.\n• In a small bowl, combine sweet Asian spice blend, hoisin sauce, the brown sugar and water.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c3be92f0a31bc0c30103f1-26c914d4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook broccoli, carrot, capsicum and onion in batches until tender, 5-6 mins.\n• Remove pan from heat and return all veggies to pan. Stir in hoisin sauce mixture and toss until combined. Season with salt and pepperto taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c3be92f0a31bc0c30103f1-e010d5d7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rice between bowls. Top with hoisin broccoli and capsicum stir-fry.\n• Sprinkle over crushed peanuts to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c3be92f0a31bc0c30103f1-d5c822ed.jpeg"
    }
  ]
